### HomeFin API walkthrough - run top to bottom.
### IntelliJ HTTP Client (built-in) or VS Code "REST Client" extension. All calls go through the gateway.
@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1) Register a customer
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "password": "S3cure#Passw0rd",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### 2) Login (IntelliJ stores the token for the next requests)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jane.doe@example.com", "password": "S3cure#Passw0rd" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 3) My profile (created asynchronously from the Kafka UserRegistered event)
GET {{gateway}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Complete profile (try invalid values to see validation errors)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "+971501234567",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-17",
  "nationalId": "784-1990-1234567-1"
}

### 5) KYC via 3rd-party provider (WireMock). nationalId starting 000 -> REJECTED, 999 -> provider outage
POST {{gateway}}/api/customers/me/kyc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) Submit a finance application (calls customer-service + valuation provider, publishes Kafka event)
POST {{gateway}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyReference": "DXB-MARINA-1204",
  "city": "Dubai",
  "propertyType": "APARTMENT",
  "propertyValue": 1500000.00,
  "financeAmount": 1000000.00,
  "tenureMonths": 300
}

> {% client.global.set("appId", response.body.id); %}

### 7) My applications (paginated)
GET {{gateway}}/api/applications?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) Login as admin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@homefin.local", "password": "Admin#12345" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 9) Admin moves the application -> customer-service logs a "notification" (Kafka)
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/applications/{{appId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "UNDER_REVIEW" }

### 10) Admin: search customers
GET {{gateway}}/api/customers?kycStatus=VERIFIED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
